<p>By using a direct psionic link to your body you can use even more therapeutics. This talent acts as an extra medical injector with <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">70%, 83%, 93%, 102%, 110%</acronym> efficiency and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">142%, 122%, 111%, 104%, 100%</acronym> cooldown mod.</p>